<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-4812] Disable EventStorageSpi by default</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-4812</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Current default implementation of &lt;tt&gt;EventStorageSpi&lt;/tt&gt; is &lt;tt&gt;MemoryEventStorageSpi&lt;/tt&gt;. It consumes a lot of memory, while is used only for events querying (i.e. not listening), which is a fairly rare use case.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Need to:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Introduce &lt;tt&gt;NoOpEventStorageSpi&lt;/tt&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Make &lt;tt&gt;NoOpEventStorageSpi&lt;/tt&gt; the default one.&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Throw an exception when &lt;tt&gt;IgniteEvents#localQuery&lt;/tt&gt; or &lt;tt&gt;#remoteQuery&lt;/tt&gt; method is called with default setting. Exception message should explain how to fix it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
</description>
                <environment></environment>
        <key id="13049984">IGNITE-4812</key>
